= Ignacy Daszyński

Ignacy Daszyński is the co-founder of the PPS and was the brief and first prime minister of independent poland. He is an excellent orator known for his attracting speeches.

- @party_discipline
- @emergency_fundraising
- @mediate_coalition
- @cabinet
- @root: Return to main

@party_discipline
title: Party Discipline
subtitle: Reduce dissent across the party.
choose-if: advisor_action_timer = 0
unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] months before next advisor action. ?]
on-arrival: advisor_action_timer = 4; internationalist_dissent -= 10; nationalist_dissent -= 10; center_dissent -= 10; labor_dissent -= 10
    
We have enforced party discipline to reduce dissent across all factions.

@emergency_fundraising
title: Emergency Fundraising
view-if: difficulty < 1
subtitle: An emergency infusion of resources.
choose-if: advisor_action_timer = 0
unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] months before next advisor action. ?]
on-arrival: advisor_action_timer = 4; resources += dues

We have gained +[+ dues +] resources.

@mediate_coalition
title: Mediate Coalition Dissent
subtitle: Daszyński can mediate coalition dissent.
choose-if: advisor_action_timer = 0 and pps_in_government and coalition_dissent >= 1
unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] months before next advisor action. ?][? if pps_in_government = 0 : The PPS isn't in the government. ?][? if coalition_dissent < 1 and pps_in_government = 0 : Our coalition partners are currently satisfied with our actions. ?]
on-arrival: advisor_action_timer = 4; coalition_dissent -= 1; coalition_dissent -= 1 if coalition_dissent >= 2

Daszyński has successfully reduced dissent in the government.

@cabinet
title: Cabinet
subtitle: Direct one of our ministries.
choose-if: advisor_action_timer = 0 and pps_in_government
unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] months before next advisor action. ?][? if pps_in_government = 0 : The PPS isn't in the government. ?]
on-arrival: advisor_action_timer = 4

Daszyński can direct our ministries.

